index 0000000..ca0f68e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/api/sections/activities.md
@@ -0,0 +1,63 @@
+# Activities
+
+Activities provide a chronological feed of events across boards the current user can access.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities`
+
+Returns a paginated list of account activity, newest first.
+
+__Query Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+|-----------|-------------|
+| `creator_ids[]` | Filter by event creator user ID(s) |
+| `board_ids[]` | Filter by board ID(s) |
+
+__Included Event Actions:__
+
+`card_assigned`, `card_unassigned`, `card_published`, `card_closed`, `card_reopened`, `card_title_changed`, `card_board_changed`, `card_postponed`, `card_auto_postponed`, `card_triaged`, `card_sent_back_to_triage`, `comment_created`
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+[
+  {
+    "id": "03f5va03bpuvkcjemcxl73ho2",
+    "action": "card_assigned",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:38:48.553Z",
+    "description": "David assigned JZ to &quot;First!&quot;",
+    "particulars": {
+      "assignee_ids": ["03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a8"]
+    },
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4",
+    "eventable_type": "Card",
+    "eventable": {
+      "id": "03f5vaeq985jlvwv3arl4srq2",
+      "number": 4,
+      "title": "First!",
+      "status": "published"
+    },
+    "board": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+      "name": "Fizzy",
+      "all_access": true
+    },
+    "creator": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+      "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+      "role": "owner",
+      "active": true
+    }
+  }
+]
+```
+
+__Particulars by Action:__
+
+- `card_assigned`, `card_unassigned`: `{ "assignee_ids": [...] }`
+- `card_board_changed`: `{ "old_board": "...", "new_board": "..." }`
+- `card_title_changed`: `{ "old_title": "...", "new_title": "..." }`
+- `card_triaged`: `{ "column": "..." }`
+- Other events: `{}`
+
+Missing `old_board`, `new_board`, `old_title`, `new_title`, or `column` values are returned as empty strings.
diff --git a/test/controllers/activities_controller_test.rb b/test/controllers/activities_controller_test.rb
